        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:AGu">AGu</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be getymum.] [Ld] ⁊ ðæt ælc man wite his getyman be mannum ⁊ be horsum ⁊ be oxum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Every man shall have knowledge of his warrantor when he buys slaves, or horses, or oxen.</ab>
